  "description": "Freyja 3D engine (Brisingamen) — STEP-first parametric CAD with addressable selector refs, measurement and assembly joints, CAD-workbench snapshot review, fabrication handoff (DXF cut layouts, FDM G-code slicing, sheet-cutting preflight, print jobs), off-the-shelf STEP part sourcing, robot description files (URDF/SRDF/SDF), implicit GLSL SDF modelling, industrial electrical/telecom enclosures, realtime web 3D, 3D motion, and asset pipeline in one lane-routed skill. Includes interference and clearance checks, mesh and kernel measurement, glTF budget audit, static defect detection, a local review viewer, verified reference assets, and a blocking delivery gate. Electrical safety/certification, FEA/CFD, and glTF conformance remain explicit external gates. Node >= 18 for verification; uv for the CAD kernel lane.",
